\textbf{A quick review of recursion} \\
Recursion is a self reference, eventually terminating in \\
a base case \\
Methods: \\
\begin{itemize}
    \item A method can call itself \\
    \item Example Fibonacci
\end{itemize} \\
Data Structures: \\
\begin{itemize}
    \item A data structure can reference itself \\
    \item Example: LinkedList is a node that points to a \\
