Search: Exploration of possibilities \\
\begin{itemize}
    \item Abstraction of general problem solving method
\end{itemize}
Basic ingredients: \\
\begin{itemize}
    \item States: describe configuration of environment \\
    \item Actions: activities which move you from one state to another \\
    \item Search algorithm: determines which actions should be tried in which order to find solution
